# Phase 1 batch testing (locked)

Default **integration / handover testing** is **not** full-match batch. Use **chunked short runs** with **live Streamlit review** while output is being built.

Full spec: [PHASE1_BATCH_TESTING.md](docs/product/PHASE1_BATCH_TESTING.md) · Catch: [CATCH_MACHINE_CURSOR_CONTEXT.md](docs/product/CATCH_MACHINE_CURSOR_CONTEXT.md)

## Default workflow (Match 4)

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Script | `scripts/run_batch_match4_5min.sh` |
| Config | `configs/batch_rtx5090.yaml` (5090/Catch) or `configs/batch_mac_stable.yaml` (Mac) |
| Duration | **5 min @ 60 fps** (`18000` frames) per cam |
| Cams | **Quad only** (P10, P9, P7, P8) — mosaic handover |
| Chunks | **1800 frames** (~30 s video); merge + promote CSV/JSON **after every chunk** |
| Output | `data/output/match_4_5min/` |
| Review | Streamlit **Expert mode** → same output root; refresh after each chunk |

Match 3 smoke: `scripts/run_phase1_2min_sample.sh` → `data/output/full_match_2min/` (same chunk/promote pattern).

## Do / don't

- **Do** run batch and mosaic on **Catch** in **tmux** when the 5090 is reachable (see `catch_remote_compute.mdc`).
- **Do** use `CAMS=P10-match4 bash scripts/run_batch_match4_5min.sh` for fastest single-cam smoke.
- **Do** keep dashboard on http://127.0.0.1:8501 while batch runs.
- **Don't** default to `run_batch_match4.sh` (full 8 cams × full MP4 ≈ 26+ h) for testing or handover.
- **Don't** run multi-hour batch or mosaic on the **Mac** if Catch is available — delegate to Catch GPU ([CATCH_REMOTE_COMPUTE.md](docs/product/CATCH_REMOTE_COMPUTE.md)).
